# cardano.org submission assets (belong in the cardano-org fork, not here)
match3rpg.png
skulliance.webp

# Digital Hell Citizens 2: Fighters -- raw trait art from Maxingo, provided for
# the trait-assembly feature. Source art we were given, not something this repo
# should redistribute: it is large, it is another artist's unreleased work, and
# nothing here is deployment-ready yet. Keep it local until we know what shape
# the shipped assets take.
#
# TWO EXCEPTIONS, AND THE RULE BEHIND THEM: what is ignored here is the ARTIST'S
# work. Files WE author or generate are ours, and a file that only reaches the
# live site by somebody remembering to FTP it is a file that goes stale --
# trait-index.json sat 12 entries behind for exactly that reason, so ten new
# traits were live reading "Dh Samurai Helmet". Anything this repo maintains
# ships with this repo.
#
#   trait-index.json  -- display names, written by us, 28K
#   neckfill/         -- generated by dhc-neckfill.php from the art, 24K total
#
# Git cannot re-include a path whose parent directory is excluded, which is why
# this is a ladder of directory exclusions rather than one line.
dhc/*
!dhc/web/
dhc/web/*
!dhc/web/trait-index.json
!dhc/web/250/
!dhc/web/1000/
dhc/web/250/*
dhc/web/1000/*
!dhc/web/250/neckfill/
!dhc/web/1000/neckfill/

# Generated Fighter composites -- rebuilt on demand, never source.
dhcrenders/
# Marquee-sized derivatives of those, for digihellcorps.php. Same rule.
images/dhc-fighters/
